":[["Mellette County in the Farmland Atlas","/farmland-atlas/south-dakota/mellette-county"],["ARC or PLC in Mellette County","/arc-plc/south-dakota/mellette-county"],["PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 13 grids runs 75 years, from 1951 to 2025. February to March and September to October each came in under 90% of normal in 39 of those years. In 2025, August to September hit 149% of normal on the middle of the grids, while October to November fell to 60%. So far in 2026, February to March came in at 29% of normal there, and grid 28016 had its driest year in 1974 at 56%.</p>"}
